===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To write or utter proverbs.
# To name in, or as, a proverb.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1671|author=John Milton|title=Samson Agonistes|lines=203–205
|passage=Am I not sung and '''proverbed''' for a fool / In every street, do they not say, "How well / Are come upon him his deserts?"}}
# To provide with a proverb.
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Romeo and Juliet|I|iv|passage=I am '''proverbed''' with a grandsire phrase.}}

{{Webster 1913}}

